\n\nTherefore:\n\n$\\,$ *$v$ is a generalized eigenvector of rank $1$ (a.k.a. an eigenvector) corresponding to the eigenvalue  $\\lambda =3$ of $A.$*\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-109506/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a0abad78-e492-5d09-a04d-bce54605c78c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-109506"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-109517/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "46aed99a-fff2-5252-9560-89a808220673" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109517/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "32a07663-fcc7-5f19-a959-c32862d20cd3" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109517/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "aab3a7bc-0688-56ef-9937-04e5189c4e7c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109517/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "4c27d54e-3efc-506b-b59d-8b7d4d12fa34" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109517/selection/03b99debc8e9534f2364927a2cf1eba83bddd906503dea5d13395ce906a45ab9" :answer/id #uuid "8b4f51ce-0352-5b68-884f-5b8cbc21a2f9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "None of the statements are true" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109517/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ce0da3b8-0788-5c27-9ed9-18bd4d3fe95d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-109517/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer-field/choices ["q-109517/s